  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Slice long chilli (if using).\n• Trim pea pods and cut into thirds.\n• Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Zest lime and cut into wedges.\n• Drain and rinse konjac noodles.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340169f7d5496ac4a5fe26/step-410b1200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium heatproof bowl, combine ginger paste, sesame seeds, chilli and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• In a large saucepan, heat olive oil (2 tbs for 2 people / 1/4 cup for 4 people) over high heat, until just smoking, 30 seconds, then carefully pour the oil over the ginger mixture.\n• Add soy sauce mix. Mix well and set aside. TIP: The hot oil will bubble up and 'cook' the ginger.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340169f7d5496ac4a5fe26/step-cf477710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Return saucepan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook pea pods, tossing, until just tender, 3-4 minutes. Add the boiling water(2 cups for 2 people / 4 cups for 4 people), chicken stock pot (see ingredients) and oyster sauce, then bring to the boil.\n• Add vegetable gyoza and lime zest and cover with a lid. Reduce to a simmer and cook until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Stir in konjac noodles and Asians greens until just wilted, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340169f7d5496ac4a5fe26/step-be08a020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide vegetable gyozas and pea pod konjac noodle soup between bowls.\n• Spoon over ginger-chilli oil. Serve with lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340169f7d5496ac4a5fe26/step-897e3730.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
